	(text "Main connector: Aptiv/FCI HCCPHPE24BKA90F (24-way 90 deg header, key A), mates 211PC249S0005.\nColumns 1 and 8 (A1-C1, A8-C8) = large high-current cavities.  Footprint: lib/ (gen/make_lib.py).\nPawl feed and lead doubled on the large pins.  CAN1 in (A3/A4) and out (A5/A6) joined on the board.\nPins marked NC: spare."
